      "zh": "（这星名叫「茵蔯」。）众水的三分之一变为茵蔯，因水变苦，就死了许多人。",
      "en": "(Now[NOTE:1] the name of the star is[NOTE:2] Wormwood.)[NOTE:3] So[NOTE:4] a third of the waters became wormwood,[NOTE:5] and many people died from these waters because they were poisoned.[NOTE:6]",
      "notes": [
        "Here καί (kai) has been translated as “now” in keeping with the parenthetical nature of this remark.",
        "Grk “is called,” but this is somewhat redundant in contemporary English.",
